  "what": "problem PD-1@v1 drafted",
  "phase": "DISCOVER",
  "minute": 55.0,
  "event_seq": 108,
  "root_problem": "Billing dispute tickets doubled from ~600/month (Jun-Jul 2026) to ~1180-1260/month (Aug-Sep 2026) (E-02). This is not explained by slow dispute handling (median 1.6d/p90 2.8d within the 3.0d SLA, E-03) nor a tariff change (none logged, E-04). A majority of disputed bills (1785 of 3025) are built from ACTUAL, not ESTIMATED, reads (E-01), indicating the billing import/validation step itself is producing wrong bills from accepted reads for most disputes, concurrent with a manual meter-read route-completion shortfall (0.88 vs 0.95 target, 9200 accounts, E-05) that is a secondary contributor via the remaining estimate-substituted disputes."
 },
